{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-artifact#card-zh","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-artifact","commit":"c5450a81d56ba3efaa860ef6b76a9614b31755d3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-artifact 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的工件插件，可将智能体产出保存为 HTML 文档或幻灯片，并在应用中浏览和编辑。它向模型提供 artifact 工具，用于列出、读取、写入和删除工件；写入内容保存在 DSH_HOME 下，浏览器侧提供会话工件标签、工件库和对话旁的阅读面板。幻灯片可在编辑器中修改并查看历史版本。适合需要留存报告、参考文档或演示稿的 DSH 用户；默认不需要 API Key，工件目录可配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:231-285","lib/store.js:184-283","lib/client.js:64-68"]}
{"unit_id":"Jannchie__dsh-artifact#card-en","repo":"Jannchie/dsh-artifact","commit":"c5450a81d56ba3efaa860ef6b76a9614b31755d3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-artifact adds saved artifacts to the DSH web client. Agents use its tool to list, read, write, and delete HTML documents or slide decks stored under DSH_HOME. The app provides a library, session list, and side panel; slide decks can be edited and revisions restored. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:231-285","lib/store.js:184-283","lib/client.js:64-68"]}
